  "flor-de-las-antillas-sungrown-toro-gordo-20-bx-m": "Experience the award-winning excellence of Flor de Las Antillas Sungrown in the substantial Toro Gordo vitola. This premium Nicaraguan cigar showcases a beautiful sungrown wrapper that delivers rich, complex flavors with perfect balance. Each draw reveals layers of cedar, leather, and subtle spice, complemented by notes of coffee and dark chocolate. The generous ring gauge provides an extended smoking experience, ideal for special occasions or leisurely moments. Handcrafted with meticulous attention to detail, these cigars offer consistent construction and an even burn throughout. The convenient 20-count box ensures you're well-stocked with these exceptional smokes. A must-have for discerning aficionados seeking full-bodied flavor and superior craftsmanship in every puff.",
