  "gurkha-cellar-resv-15yr-hedonism-20-bx": "Indulge in the ultimate smoking experience with Gurkha Cellar Reserve 15 Year Hedonism cigars. This premium collection showcases Gurkha's commitment to luxury and craftsmanship, featuring meticulously aged tobaccos that have been carefully cellared for fifteen years. Each cigar delivers an exceptionally smooth, complex flavor profile with rich, mature notes that develop beautifully throughout the smoking experience. The extended aging process creates unparalleled depth and refinement, making every draw a sophisticated pleasure. Packaged in an elegant 20-count box, these cigars represent the pinnacle of tobacco artistry. Perfect for special occasions or the discerning enthusiast who appreciates the finer things in life, the Hedonism lives up to its provocative name with pure smoking decadence.",
