  "gurkha-cellar-resv-15yr-prisoner-churchill-20-bx": "Experience the exceptional craftsmanship of Gurkha's Cellar Reserve 15 Year Prisoner Churchill cigars. These premium cigars showcase tobacco aged for 15 years, delivering remarkable complexity and depth that only time can create. The Churchill vitola offers an extended smoking experience, perfect for contemplative moments and special occasions. Each cigar features carefully selected tobaccos that have developed rich, nuanced flavors through patient aging. The \"Prisoner\" designation reflects the tobacco's confinement during the lengthy aging process, resulting in a sophisticated smoke with layered complexity. Expect notes of cedar, leather, and subtle spice balanced by the smoothness that comes from proper maturation. Presented in a box of 20, these cigars represent Gurkha's commitment to excellence and the art of premium cigar making. A distinguished choice for the discerning aficionado.",
  "gurkha-cellar-resv-15yr-solaro-dbl-robusto-20-bx": "Experience the pinnacle of premium cigar craftsmanship with the Gurkha Cellar Reserve 15 Year Solaro Double Robusto. This exceptional cigar features tobaccos aged for 15 years, delivering unparalleled depth and complexity. The Solaro wrapper, kissed by Caribbean sunshine, provides a beautiful golden hue and rich, mellow flavor profile. Each double robusto offers a luxurious smoking experience with notes of cedar, leather, and subtle spice, balanced by natural sweetness from the extended aging process. The expert construction ensures an even burn and perfect draw throughout. Presented in an elegant 20-count box, these cigars represent Gurkha's commitment to excellence and tradition. Perfect for special occasions or the discerning aficionado seeking a truly memorable smoke. A distinguished addition to any serious cigar collection.",
