  "gurkha-grand-reserve-conn-churchill-congnac30-bx": "The Gurkha Grand Reserve Connecticut Churchill represents the pinnacle of premium cigar craftsmanship. This exceptional Churchill features a silky Connecticut shade wrapper that delivers a smooth, creamy smoking experience with subtle complexity. Each cigar is infused with fine cognac, adding luxurious notes of vanilla, caramel, and aged oak that complement the mild-to-medium bodied blend perfectly. Meticulously constructed with premium long-filler tobaccos, these cigars offer an effortless draw and even burn throughout the generous Churchill vitola. The cognac infusion creates a sophisticated flavor profile that appeals to both seasoned aficionados and those seeking an elevated smoking experience. Presented in an elegant 30-count box, the Gurkha Grand Reserve Connecticut Churchill makes an impressive addition to any humidor or serves as the perfect gift for discerning cigar enthusiasts who appreciate the finer things in life.",
