  "gurkha-nicaragua-series-robusto-20-bx": "Experience the bold character of Nicaragua with this exceptional Gurkha robusto. Crafted with premium Nicaraguan tobaccos, this medium to full-bodied cigar delivers a rich, complex smoking experience that showcases the finest terroir of Central America's renowned tobacco regions. The expertly constructed robusto format provides the perfect balance of flavor concentration and smoking time, typically offering 45-60 minutes of enjoyment. Each cigar features Gurkha's signature attention to detail, from the flawless construction to the smooth, even burn. Expect notes of earth, spice, and natural tobacco sweetness that develop beautifully throughout the smoke. This 20-count box ensures you'll have plenty of these premium Nicaraguan cigars to savor or share with fellow enthusiasts who appreciate quality craftsmanship and authentic tobacco flavor.",
  "gurkha-nicaragua-series-toro-20-bx": "Experience the bold complexity of Gurkha's Nicaragua Series Toro, a premium handcrafted cigar that showcases the rich volcanic soils of Nicaragua. This expertly constructed toro delivers a full-bodied smoking experience with layers of earth, leather, and subtle spice that evolve beautifully throughout the smoke. The carefully selected Nicaraguan tobaccos are perfectly balanced to create a robust yet refined profile that satisfies even the most discerning palate. Each 20-count box contains consistently crafted cigars featuring excellent construction and an even burn. Whether for special occasions or regular enjoyment, the Nicaragua Series Toro represents Gurkha's commitment to quality and tradition. Perfect for experienced cigar enthusiasts who appreciate the distinctive character of Nicaraguan tobacco.",
