  "la-gloria-cubana-serie-r-5-natural-24-bx": "Experience the robust character of La Gloria Cubana Serie R #5 Natural, a premium Nicaraguan cigar that delivers exceptional complexity and strength. Handcrafted in Estel\u00ed, this full-bodied smoke features a rich, oily Nicaraguan wrapper that conceals a carefully selected blend of aged long-filler tobaccos. The #5 vitola offers the perfect balance of burn time and intensity, producing dense, flavorful smoke with notes of earth, leather, and subtle spice. Each draw reveals layers of complexity that evolve throughout the smoking experience. Presented in a convenient 24-count box, these cigars are ideal for the discerning smoker who appreciates bold, traditional flavors and superior construction from one of Nicaragua's most respected cigar regions.",
