  "macanudo-inspirado-white-toro-20-bx": "Experience the refined elegance of Macanudo Inspirado White Toro, a premium cigar that embodies sophisticated craftsmanship. This exceptional blend features a pristine Ecuadoran Connecticut Shade wrapper that delivers a smooth, creamy smoking experience with subtle complexity. The carefully selected Nicaraguan and Dominican long-filler tobaccos create a harmonious medium-bodied profile with notes of cedar, cream, and gentle spice. Each 6x50 Toro offers an ideal balance of flavor and construction, providing a consistent draw and even burn throughout the smoking experience. The Inspirado White represents Macanudo's commitment to innovation while honoring traditional cigar-making excellence. This box contains 20 meticulously crafted cigars, perfect for the discerning enthusiast seeking a refined, approachable smoke that delivers both elegance and satisfaction in every puff.",
