  "macanudo-rothschild-6-1-fresh-pack": "Experience the smooth, mellow sophistication of Macanudo Rothschild cigars in this convenient fresh pack. These premium handmade cigars feature a silky Connecticut Shade wrapper that delivers the signature Macanudo taste - creamy, balanced, and consistently satisfying. The Rothschild vitola offers a perfect 4.5 x 50 ring gauge for a comfortable 30-45 minute smoke, making it ideal for both newcomers and seasoned enthusiasts. Crafted with carefully aged Dominican and Jamaican tobaccos, each cigar provides notes of cedar, cream, and subtle sweetness. The fresh pack packaging ensures optimal humidity and freshness, preserving the cigars' quality from factory to your humidor. Perfect for relaxing moments, business occasions, or introducing friends to premium cigars. A trusted choice that has defined smooth smoking excellence for decades.",
