  "maven-alpha-chrome-refilable-torch": "Experience precision ignition with the Maven Alpha Chrome Refillable Torch, engineered for reliability and style. This premium torch lighter features a durable chrome finish that resists wear while delivering consistent, wind-resistant flames. The refillable butane system ensures long-lasting performance, making it perfect for cigars, pipes, and outdoor applications. Its ergonomic design provides comfortable handling and secure grip, while the adjustable flame control allows for customized lighting intensity. Built with quality materials and refined craftsmanship, the Maven Alpha combines functionality with sophisticated aesthetics for the discerning enthusiast who demands both performance and elegance.",
