  "maven-alpha-mini-transparent-torch-display": "This compact transparent torch lighter delivers reliable performance in a sleek, see-through design that showcases its internal mechanics. The MAVEN ALPHA MINI features a powerful windproof flame perfect for cigars, pipes, and outdoor lighting needs. Its transparent construction allows you to monitor fuel levels at a glance, while the ergonomic design ensures comfortable handling. The adjustable flame control provides precise heat output for any situation. Built with durable materials and a reliable ignition system, this torch lighter combines functionality with visual appeal. The compact size makes it ideal for travel or everyday carry, while the transparent body adds a modern aesthetic to your smoking accessories collection.",
  "maven-alpha-neon-refilable-torch": "Experience precision lighting with the MAVEN ALPHA NEON torch lighter. This refillable butane torch delivers consistent, wind-resistant flames perfect for cigars, pipes, and outdoor activities. Features a sleek design with eye-catching neon accents that stand out in any collection. The adjustable flame control ensures optimal performance for various lighting needs, while the refillable mechanism provides long-lasting value. Built with durable construction and ergonomic grip for comfortable handling. The powerful torch flame ignites reliably in challenging conditions, making it an essential tool for smoking enthusiasts and outdoor adventurers alike.",
  "maven-alpha-sequoia-refilable-torch": "Experience precision lighting with the Maven Alpha Sequoia Refillable Torch, engineered for cigar enthusiasts who demand reliability and performance. This premium torch lighter delivers a powerful, wind-resistant flame that ensures consistent ignition in any conditions. The robust construction features a comfortable grip and intuitive operation, while the large fuel capacity minimizes frequent refills. The adjustable flame control allows you to customize the heat intensity for different cigar sizes and personal preferences. Built with quality materials for long-lasting durability, this refillable torch combines functionality with sleek design. The efficient fuel system and easy-fill valve make maintenance simple, ensuring your lighting tool is always ready when you need it most.",
