  "montecristo-1935-anniversary-no-2-10-bx": "Celebrate nearly nine decades of Cuban cigar excellence with the Montecristo 1935 Anniversary No.2. This premium torpedo pays homage to the legendary brand's founding year, delivering the sophisticated complexity that has made Montecristo synonymous with luxury smoking. Crafted with meticulously aged Cuban tobaccos, each cigar offers a refined smoking experience with rich, nuanced flavors that develop beautifully throughout the draw. The classic torpedo shape provides an elegant smoking ritual, while the expert construction ensures an even burn and perfect draw. Presented in a traditional 10-count box, these anniversary cigars represent the pinnacle of Cuban cigar artistry. A distinguished choice for connoisseurs who appreciate heritage, craftsmanship, and the timeless appeal of authentic Cuban tobacco. Perfect for special occasions or adding prestige to any humidor collection.",
  "montecristo-1935-anniversary-toro-10-bx": "Celebrate nearly a century of cigar-making excellence with the Montecristo 1935 Anniversary Toro. This premium commemorative blend honors the legendary Cuban brand's founding year with a meticulously crafted smoking experience. The 6x50 toro format delivers a perfect balance of draw and burn, allowing the complex flavor profile to fully develop throughout your session. Each cigar showcases Montecristo's signature medium to full-bodied character, featuring rich notes of cedar, leather, and subtle spice with hints of cocoa and coffee. The expertly constructed wrapper ensures an even burn and consistent draw from first light to final puff. This box of 10 cigars makes an exceptional addition to any humidor or a memorable gift for the discerning aficionado who appreciates heritage and craftsmanship.",
