  "montecristo-classic-especial-no-3-20-bx": "Experience the refined elegance of Montecristo Classic Especial No.3, a premium cigar that embodies decades of Cuban tobacco craftsmanship. This medium-bodied smoke delivers a perfectly balanced blend of rich, earthy flavors with subtle notes of cedar, coffee, and spice. Each cigar features expertly aged tobaccos wrapped in a smooth, golden-brown leaf that burns evenly for a consistently satisfying experience. The Especial No.3 offers an ideal smoking time of approximately 45-60 minutes, making it perfect for both seasoned aficionados and discerning newcomers. Presented in an elegant box of 20 cigars, this classic vitola maintains Montecristo's legendary reputation for quality and consistency. Whether for special occasions or personal enjoyment, these cigars represent the pinnacle of traditional tobacco artistry and sophisticated taste.",
  "montecristo-classic-no-2-20-bx": "Experience the legendary craftsmanship of Cuba's most prestigious cigar house with the Montecristo Classic No. 2. This iconic torpedo-shaped cigar delivers the signature medium-bodied blend that has defined excellence for generations. Hand-rolled with premium aged tobaccos, each cigar offers complex layers of cedar, leather, and subtle spice with a smooth, creamy finish. The Classic No. 2's distinctive pointed cap and elegant construction make it perfect for special occasions or the discerning aficionado's regular rotation. Packaged in a traditional wooden box of 20 cigars, this timeless selection represents the pinnacle of cigar artistry and Cuban tobacco heritage.",
