  "montecristo-double-corona-25-bx": "Experience the pinnacle of Cuban cigar craftsmanship with the Montecristo Double Corona. This premium cigar delivers the legendary Montecristo flavor profile in a generous Double Corona vitola, offering an extended smoking experience of rich, complex flavors. Hand-rolled with carefully aged tobacco, each cigar presents medium-bodied notes of cedar, earth, and subtle spice with hints of cocoa and coffee. The expertly constructed wrapper ensures an even burn and smooth draw throughout the lengthy smoking session. Presented in a traditional box of 25 cigars, this is the perfect choice for discerning aficionados who appreciate both quality and quantity. Ideal for special occasions or adding to your humidor collection.",
