  "montecristo-espada-quillion-10-bx": "Experience the bold artistry of Montecristo Espada Quillion, a masterfully crafted premium cigar that embodies strength and sophistication. This full-bodied blend features carefully selected Nicaraguan tobaccos wrapped in a rich, oily Habano Rosado leaf that delivers complex layers of leather, dark chocolate, and warm spices. The Quillion vitola offers an extended smoking experience with exceptional construction and draw consistency. Each cigar showcases Montecristo's legendary attention to detail, from the perfectly applied triple cap to the balanced burn. Presented in an elegant 10-count box, these cigars are ideal for the discerning aficionado seeking intensity without sacrificing refinement. The Espada line represents Montecristo's venture into bolder territory while maintaining their reputation for impeccable quality and craftsmanship.",
  "montecristo-espada-ricasso-10-bx": "The Montecristo Espada Ricasso delivers a bold, full-bodied smoking experience that exemplifies the legendary Montecristo craftsmanship. This premium cigar features a rich Ecuadorian Habano wrapper surrounding carefully aged Nicaraguan long-fillers, creating complex layers of leather, dark chocolate, and spice. The Ricasso vitola offers an ideal balance of strength and refinement, with a smooth draw and even burn throughout. Each cigar showcases the distinctive band design that pays homage to the finest Spanish steel, while the construction ensures consistent performance from light to finish. Presented in a convenient 10-count box, these cigars are perfect for the discerning smoker seeking an authentic, memorable experience that honors the Montecristo legacy.",
  "montecristo-freshloc-bag-4-pack": "Keep your premium cigars in perfect condition with the Montecristo FreshLoc Bag 4-Pack. These innovative storage bags are specifically designed to maintain optimal humidity levels, preserving the flavor, aroma, and quality of your cigars. Each airtight bag features advanced moisture control technology that prevents your cigars from drying out or becoming over-humidified. Perfect for travel, gifting, or short-term storage, these convenient bags offer professional-grade protection without the need for a traditional humidor. The pack includes four individual FreshLoc bags, making them ideal for organizing different cigar varieties or sharing with fellow enthusiasts. Essential for any cigar aficionado who demands excellence in preservation.",
