  "montecristo-robusto-25-bx": "Experience the legendary craftsmanship of Cuba's most celebrated cigar with the Montecristo Robusto. This premium 25-count box delivers the brand's signature medium to full-bodied profile that has captivated aficionados for generations. Each robusto offers a perfectly balanced blend of rich, earthy flavors with subtle notes of cedar, leather, and cocoa, creating a sophisticated smoking experience that builds beautifully from first light to final draw. Hand-rolled with meticulous attention to detail, these cigars feature flawless construction and even burn characteristics. The classic robusto vitola provides an ideal 45-60 minute smoke, making it perfect for both seasoned connoisseurs and those exploring premium Cuban tobacco. A timeless choice representing cigar excellence.",
  "montecristo-white-churchill-27-bx": "The Montecristo White Churchill delivers a refined smoking experience with its elegant Connecticut Shade wrapper and expertly crafted 7x50 Churchill vitola. This premium cigar showcases Montecristo's legendary blending expertise through a smooth, creamy profile featuring notes of cedar, light pepper, and subtle sweetness. The silky Connecticut wrapper conceals a carefully selected blend of aged tobaccos that burn evenly and consistently. Perfect for both seasoned aficionados and those seeking a milder smoking experience, this Churchill offers a luxurious 90-minute smoke with exceptional construction and draw. Each box contains 27 cigars, making it ideal for special occasions or as an impressive gift for cigar enthusiasts who appreciate quality and tradition.",
  "montecristo-white-montecristo-court-15-bx": "Experience the refined elegance of Montecristo White Court cigars, a sophisticated addition to the legendary Montecristo portfolio. These premium cigars feature a beautiful Connecticut Shade wrapper that delivers a smooth, creamy smoking experience with subtle complexity. The Court size offers an ideal balance of flavor and smoking time, making it perfect for both seasoned aficionados and those seeking a milder profile. Each cigar showcases Montecristo's commitment to exceptional craftsmanship and quality tobacco selection. The Connecticut wrapper provides notes of cedar, cream, and gentle spice, creating a harmonious and approachable smoke. This 15-count box ensures you'll have plenty of these exquisite cigars to enjoy or share with fellow enthusiasts.",
  "montecristo-white-no-2-torpedo-27-bx": "Experience the refined elegance of Montecristo White No.2 Torpedo, a premium cigar that exemplifies masterful craftsmanship. This torpedo-shaped beauty features a silky Connecticut Shade wrapper that delivers a smooth, creamy smoking experience with subtle complexity. The expertly blended filler tobaccos create gentle notes of cedar, cream, and light spice, making it perfect for both newcomers and seasoned enthusiasts seeking a milder profile. Each draw reveals the meticulous attention to detail that has made Montecristo a legendary name in premium cigars. The torpedo vitola offers an excellent draw and even burn, ensuring a consistently satisfying smoke from first light to final puff. Sold in boxes of 27.",
  "montecristo-white-prontos-5-6-tins": "Experience the refined elegance of Montecristo White Prontos, premium small cigars that deliver the legendary Montecristo quality in a convenient format. These expertly crafted cigars feature a smooth Connecticut Shade wrapper that imparts a creamy, mellow flavor profile perfect for any time of day. Each tin contains 6 cigars, with this package including 5 tins for a total of 30 cigars. The Prontos offer a consistent, even burn with notes of cedar, cream, and subtle spice that Montecristo enthusiasts have come to expect. Their compact size makes them ideal for shorter smoking sessions while maintaining the complexity and craftsmanship of full-sized premium cigars. Perfect for travel, office breaks, or when you want to enjoy exceptional tobacco in limited time.",
