  "my-father-fonseca-cedros-20-bx": "Experience the exceptional craftsmanship of My Father Cigars with the Fonseca Cedros, a premium offering that showcases the legendary Garcia family's tobacco mastery. These handcrafted cigars deliver a rich, complex smoking experience with notes of cedar, earth, and subtle spice that develop beautifully throughout the smoke. The carefully selected tobaccos create a medium to full-bodied profile that appeals to both seasoned aficionados and discerning newcomers. Each box contains 20 meticulously constructed cigars, perfect for special occasions or building your personal collection. The Fonseca Cedros represents the perfect marriage of traditional Cuban techniques with the bold flavors that have made My Father Cigars a standout in the premium cigar market. Expect consistent draw, even burn, and the distinctive quality that defines the My Father brand.",
