  "my-father-la-promesa-toro-20-bx": "Experience the exceptional craftsmanship of My Father Cigars with La Promesa Toro, a premium smoking experience that delivers rich, complex flavors in every draw. This full-bodied cigar showcases the Garcia family's renowned blending expertise, featuring carefully selected tobaccos that create a perfectly balanced profile of earth, spice, and subtle sweetness. The Toro vitola offers an ideal smoking time with consistent burn and excellent construction throughout. Each box contains 20 meticulously crafted cigars, making it perfect for the discerning aficionado or as an impressive gift. La Promesa represents My Father's commitment to quality and tradition, delivering the bold character and superior craftsmanship that has made this brand a favorite among cigar enthusiasts worldwide. A truly rewarding smoke for those who appreciate authentic Cuban-style tobacco artistry.",
