  "my-father-le-bijou-1922-toro-23-bx": "Experience the pinnacle of premium cigar craftsmanship with the My Father Le Bijou 1922 Toro. This exceptional full-bodied cigar showcases the Garcia family's legendary tobacco expertise, featuring a rich Habano Oscuro wrapper that delivers complex layers of flavor. Expect bold notes of dark chocolate, espresso, leather, and warm spices that evolve beautifully throughout your smoking experience. The expertly constructed 6x52 toro format provides an optimal draw and even burn, ensuring maximum enjoyment. Hand-rolled with premium Nicaraguan tobaccos and aged to perfection, each cigar represents the pinnacle of boutique cigar making. This box of 23 cigars offers exceptional value for the discerning aficionado seeking a truly memorable smoking experience that honors traditional Cuban craftsmanship.",
