  "my-father-no-1-robusto-23-bx": "Experience the pinnacle of Nicaraguan craftsmanship with the My Father No.1 Robusto. This premium cigar showcases the Garc\u00eda family's decades of tobacco expertise, featuring carefully selected Nicaraguan tobaccos that deliver a full-bodied smoking experience. The robusto vitola offers the perfect balance of strength and complexity, with rich notes of earth, pepper, and subtle sweetness that evolve throughout the smoke. Hand-rolled with meticulous attention to detail, each cigar features flawless construction and an even burn. The dark, oily wrapper promises a satisfying draw and generous smoke production. Presented in a box of 23 cigars, the My Father No.1 represents exceptional value for discerning smokers seeking authentic Nicaraguan character and consistent quality in every stick.",
