  "neon-5x-lighter-butane-can": "Premium butane refill fuel designed for reliable lighter performance. This high-quality butane delivers consistent flame ignition and burns cleanly without residue buildup. Compatible with most refillable butane lighters including torch lighters, table lighters, and pocket models. Features easy-fill valve system for mess-free refueling. Ultra-refined formula ensures optimal lighter function and extends equipment lifespan. Essential maintenance supply for cigar enthusiasts, pipe smokers, and lighter collectors. Compact canister provides multiple refills for everyday use. Store in cool, dry conditions away from heat sources. Perfect for keeping your favorite lighters operating at peak performance.",
  "neon-5x-lighter-butane-can-case": "Protect and organize your butane refill cans with this vibrant NEON 5X Lighter Butane Can Case. Designed to securely hold up to five standard butane canisters, this durable case features eye-catching neon coloring for easy identification in your smoking accessories collection. The compact design fits perfectly in toolkits, glove compartments, or workshop storage areas. Sturdy construction shields your butane supplies from damage while keeping them neatly arranged and readily accessible. Essential for serious lighter enthusiasts, cigar aficionados, and anyone who values organized flame fuel storage. Butane cans sold separately.",
  "neon-7x-lighter-butane-can": "High-performance butane refill designed for reliable lighter operation. This premium-grade butane fuel delivers consistent flame performance and clean burning for optimal lighter function. Compatible with most refillable butane lighters including torch lighters, cigar lighters, and standard pocket lighters. The pressurized canister ensures efficient fuel transfer and long-lasting supply. Features universal adapter tips to fit various lighter models. Clean-burning formula prevents clogging and maintains lighter mechanisms. Essential fuel source for cigar enthusiasts and daily lighter users who demand dependable ignition. Compact size makes it convenient for home, office, or travel use.",
  "neon-7x-lighter-butane-can-case": "Keep your butane refills organized and protected with this durable NEON 7X lighter case. Designed to securely hold butane cans, this practical storage solution prevents damage and leaks while maintaining easy access to your fuel supply. The vibrant neon finish adds visibility for quick identification in toolkits, workshops, or storage areas. Compact yet sturdy construction ensures reliable protection for your butane canisters during transport or storage. Essential for lighter enthusiasts, collectors, and anyone who regularly uses refillable butane lighters. Helps extend the life of your fuel cans while keeping them safely contained.",
