  "nica-rustica-short-robusto-25-bx": "Experience the bold intensity of Nica Rustica Short Robusto, a powerhouse cigar that delivers unapologetic strength and complex flavors. Crafted with premium Nicaraguan tobaccos, this compact robusto format packs maximum impact into a shorter smoking experience, perfect for when time is limited but satisfaction cannot be compromised. Each cigar showcases rich, earthy notes with hints of pepper, leather, and dark chocolate, creating a robust profile that appeals to seasoned enthusiasts seeking full-bodied intensity. The expert construction ensures an even burn and consistent draw throughout the smoking experience. Packaged in a convenient 25-count box, these Short Robustos are ideal for sharing with fellow aficionados or building your personal collection. Perfect for outdoor adventures, quick smoke breaks, or whenever you crave the distinctive character that only Nica Rustica can deliver.",
  "nub-354-connecticut-24-bx-by-oliva": "Experience the refined elegance of NUB 354 Connecticut cigars, expertly crafted by renowned Oliva Cigars. These premium short smokes feature a silky Connecticut Shade wrapper that delivers a smooth, creamy profile with subtle notes of cedar, nuts, and gentle spice. The NUB's unique short, thick vitola concentrates the tobacco's essence, providing the full smoking experience of a larger cigar in a condensed format. Perfect for time-conscious aficionados who refuse to compromise on quality. Each cigar burns evenly with excellent construction, offering approximately 45-60 minutes of refined enjoyment. This 24-count box ensures you'll have plenty of these exceptional Connecticut cigars on hand for any occasion. Ideal for both novice and experienced smokers seeking a mellow, sophisticated smoke.",
