  "nub-358-connecticut-24-bx-by-oliva": "Experience the refined elegance of NUB 358 Connecticut cigars, expertly crafted by Oliva. These premium short-format cigars feature a beautiful Connecticut wrapper that delivers a smooth, creamy smoking experience with subtle complexity. The 3.75\" x 58 ring gauge provides an ideal balance of flavor and smoking time, perfect for those seeking quality without the lengthy commitment. Each cigar showcases Oliva's renowned blending expertise, offering notes of cedar, cream, and gentle spice that develop beautifully throughout the smoke. The Connecticut wrapper's natural sweetness creates an approachable yet sophisticated profile suitable for both newcomers and seasoned enthusiasts. Available in convenient 24-count boxes, these cigars represent exceptional value and consistent quality from one of the industry's most respected manufacturers.",
