  "nub-464t-cameroon-torpedo-24-bx-by-oliva": "Experience the premium craftsmanship of NUB 464T Cameroon Torpedo cigars by Oliva. These expertly constructed torpedoes feature a golden-brown Cameroon wrapper that delivers a smooth, creamy smoking experience with subtle sweetness and complexity. The 4x64 ring gauge provides the perfect balance of flavor concentration and smoking time, making them ideal for both seasoned aficionados and newcomers to premium cigars. Each cigar showcases Oliva's renowned attention to detail and consistent construction quality. The torpedo shape allows for an excellent draw and even burn throughout your smoking session. Packaged in a convenient 24-count box, these cigars represent exceptional value from one of the industry's most respected manufacturers. Perfect for personal enjoyment or sharing with fellow cigar enthusiasts.",
  "nub-464t-connecticut-torpedo-24-bx-by-oliva": "Experience the refined elegance of NUB 464T Connecticut Torpedo cigars by Oliva. These premium torpedoes showcase a silky Connecticut wrapper that delivers a smooth, creamy smoking experience with subtle complexity. The 4x64 vitola offers the perfect balance of flavor concentration and smoking time, while the distinctive torpedo shape provides an enhanced draw and focused flavor delivery. Crafted with Oliva's renowned attention to detail, each cigar features carefully selected tobaccos that create notes of cedar, cream, and gentle spice. The Connecticut wrapper contributes natural sweetness and a golden appearance that's as appealing as the taste. Sold in convenient 24-count boxes, these cigars are ideal for both everyday enjoyment and special occasions. Perfect for golfers, business meetings, or relaxing evenings when you want exceptional quality in a shorter smoking session.",
  "nub-464t-habano-torpedo-24-bx-by-oliva": "Experience the concentrated intensity of NUB 464T Habano Torpedo cigars by Oliva. These expertly crafted torpedoes deliver the essence of a full-size cigar in a compact 4x64 format, eliminating the need to \"smoke past\" milder opening notes. The Habano wrapper provides rich, complex flavors with notes of cedar, leather, and subtle spice, while the torpedo shape offers an exceptional draw and focused flavor delivery. Each cigar burns consistently for approximately 45 minutes of pure smoking pleasure. Hand-rolled with premium Nicaraguan tobaccos and Oliva's renowned attention to detail, this 24-count box ensures you'll have plenty of these bold, satisfying smokes on hand for any occasion.",
