  "rocky-patel-edge-corojo-robusto-20-bx": "Experience the bold intensity of Rocky Patel Edge Corojo Robusto cigars. This premium blend features a stunning Corojo wrapper that delivers rich, complex flavors with notes of cedar, leather, and subtle spice. The robusto vitola offers the perfect balance of smoking time and flavor concentration, providing a medium to full-bodied experience that satisfies seasoned enthusiasts. Each box contains 20 expertly crafted cigars, showcasing Rocky Patel's commitment to quality and consistency. The Edge series represents the pinnacle of bold smoking pleasure, making these cigars ideal for special occasions or everyday indulgence.",
