  "rocky-patel-edge-maduro-torpedo-100-ct-tray": "The Rocky Patel Edge Maduro Torpedo delivers a bold, full-bodied smoking experience with its distinctive dark Maduro wrapper. This premium torpedo-shaped cigar features expertly aged tobaccos that create rich, complex flavors with notes of chocolate, coffee, and subtle spice. The pointed torpedo tip provides an excellent draw and concentrated flavor delivery. Each cigar showcases Rocky Patel's commitment to quality construction and consistent burn. Perfect for experienced cigar enthusiasts seeking intensity and depth. This 100-count tray offers exceptional value for retailers or serious collectors looking to stock this popular Maduro blend.",
