  "rocky-patel-sixty-toro-20-bx": "Experience the bold sophistication of Rocky Patel Sixty Toro cigars, expertly crafted for the discerning smoker. This premium toro format delivers a rich, complex smoking experience with Rocky Patel's signature attention to detail and quality construction. Each cigar showcases carefully selected tobaccos that create layers of flavor, from the initial draw through the satisfying finish. The toro size provides an ideal balance of smoking time and flavor development, making it perfect for both seasoned aficionados and those exploring premium cigars. Conveniently packaged in a box of 20, these cigars are ideal for personal enjoyment or sharing with fellow enthusiasts. Rocky Patel's commitment to excellence ensures consistent quality and an exceptional smoking experience with every cigar.",
