  "rocky-patel-sun-grown-maduro-robusto-20-bx": "Experience the bold complexity of Rocky Patel Sun Grown Maduro Robusto cigars, expertly crafted for the discerning smoker. These premium cigars feature a rich, dark maduro wrapper that delivers a full-bodied smoking experience with deep, robust flavors. The sun-grown tobacco creates layers of complexity, offering notes of earth, leather, and subtle sweetness with a satisfying finish. Each robusto measures perfectly for an ideal smoking duration, providing consistent construction and even burn throughout. This box of 20 cigars represents exceptional value for Rocky Patel's renowned quality and craftsmanship. Perfect for special occasions or adding to your humidor collection, these maduro robustos showcase why Rocky Patel remains a trusted name among cigar enthusiasts seeking premium smoking experiences.",
