  "ronson-42gms-multi-fill-ultra-butane-fuel": "Premium ultra-refined butane fuel designed for optimal performance in quality lighters, torches, and smoking accessories. This 42-gram canister delivers consistent, clean-burning fuel with minimal impurities, ensuring reliable ignition and steady flame output. The multi-fill formula works with most butane-powered devices including cigar lighters, pipe lighters, and culinary torches. Ronson's advanced refinement process removes moisture and contaminants that can clog lighter mechanisms or affect flame quality. Features universal filling tip compatibility for easy refueling of various lighter brands and models. Essential maintenance fuel for discerning smokers who demand dependable performance from their lighting instruments. Keep your premium lighters functioning at peak efficiency with this professional-grade butane solution.",
  "ronson-76g-12pk-butane-fuel": "Premium butane fuel specifically designed for Ronson lighters and torches. This 12-pack of high-quality butane canisters delivers consistent, clean-burning fuel for reliable ignition every time. The refined butane formula burns efficiently with minimal residue, helping extend the life of your lighter mechanisms. Each canister features precision dispensing tips that fit most standard butane lighters and torch applications. Perfect for refilling cigar torches, pocket lighters, and culinary torches. The bulk 12-pack ensures you'll always have fuel on hand when needed. Ronson's trusted quality guarantees optimal performance and flame consistency. Compatible with most butane-powered devices requiring standard fuel cartridges.",
  "rp-vintage-1990-toro-tubo-5-bun": "The Rocky Patel Vintage 1990 Toro Tubo delivers a sophisticated smoking experience wrapped in premium aluminum tubes for ultimate protection and portability. This medium-bodied toro features a carefully aged Connecticut Broadleaf wrapper that imparts rich, complex flavors with notes of cedar, leather, and subtle spice. Each 6x50 vitola is meticulously crafted for an even burn and smooth draw, showcasing Rocky Patel's commitment to quality construction. The individual tube packaging preserves freshness while making these cigars perfect for travel or gifting. This 5-cigar bundle represents exceptional value for premium handmade cigars. The Vintage 1990 blend has earned acclaim among enthusiasts for its balanced profile that appeals to both seasoned aficionados and those developing their palate. Ideal for special occasions or everyday enjoyment.",
  "ryj-reserva-real-nicaragua-churchill-25-bx": "Experience the bold fusion of Cuban heritage and Nicaraguan terroir with the Romeo y Julieta Reserva Real Nicaragua Churchill. This premium 7x50 Churchill format delivers a full-bodied smoking experience that showcases the rich volcanic soils of Nicaragua. Expertly crafted with aged Nicaraguan tobaccos, this cigar offers complex layers of earth, leather, and spice with hints of dark chocolate and coffee. The seamless construction ensures an even burn and perfect draw throughout the generous smoking time. Each box contains 25 cigars, making it ideal for the serious aficionado seeking consistent quality and robust flavor. Country of Origin: Nicaragua Wrapper: Nicaraguan Shape: Churchill (7x50) Profile: Full-bodied",
  "ryj-reserva-real-nicaragua-magnum-20-bx": "Experience the rich heritage of Romeo y Julieta with the Reserva Real Nicaragua Magnum. This premium cigar showcases expertly aged Nicaraguan tobaccos, delivering a full-bodied smoking experience with complex layers of earth, spice, and leather. The magnum vitola offers an extended, luxurious smoke perfect for special occasions or contemplative evenings. Hand-rolled with meticulous attention to detail, each cigar features a beautiful dark wrapper and excellent construction. The 20-count box ensures proper storage and makes an impressive gift for the discerning aficionado. A sophisticated addition to any humidor from this legendary Cuban brand.",
  "ryj-reserva-real-nicaragua-robusto-25-bx": "Experience the bold character of Nicaragua with Romeo y Julieta's Reserva Real Robusto. This premium cigar showcases rich Nicaraguan tobaccos expertly blended to deliver a full-bodied smoking experience with notes of earth, spice, and cedar. The robusto vitola offers the perfect balance of flavor intensity and smoking time, making it ideal for both seasoned aficionados and those seeking a robust upgrade. Each box contains 25 meticulously crafted cigars featuring consistent construction and draw. A sophisticated choice for special occasions or when you crave the distinctive complexity that only Nicaraguan tobacco can provide.",
  "ryj-reserva-real-nicaragua-toro-25-bx": "Experience the exceptional craftsmanship of Romeo y Julieta's Reserva Real Nicaragua Toro. This premium cigar showcases rich Nicaraguan tobaccos expertly blended to deliver a medium to full-bodied smoking experience. The 6x50 Toro vitola provides an ideal balance of flavor and smoking time, featuring complex notes of earth, spice, and subtle sweetness. Each cigar is meticulously constructed with flawless draw and even burn characteristics. Presented in an elegant 25-count box, these cigars represent the pinnacle of Romeo y Julieta's Nicaraguan tobacco expertise, perfect for discerning aficionados seeking authentic premium quality.",
