  "tabak-especial-dulce-robusto-24-bx": "Experience the luxurious fusion of premium tobacco and rich coffee with Tabak Especial Dulce Robusto. Drew Estate masterfully crafts these exceptional cigars by infusing select Nicaraguan tobacco with authentic Guatemalan coffee, creating an indulgent smoking experience that captivates the senses. The robusto vitola delivers a smooth, medium-bodied profile with notes of dark roast coffee, subtle sweetness, and earthy tobacco undertones. Each draw reveals layers of complexity, from the initial coffee aromatics to the satisfying tobacco finish. The construction ensures an even burn and consistent flavor throughout. Perfect for coffee enthusiasts and cigar connoisseurs seeking something uniquely satisfying. This 24-count box offers exceptional value for those who appreciate Drew Estate's innovative approach to premium cigars. Ideal for special occasions or as a distinctive addition to any humidor collection.",
  "tabak-especial-dulce-toro-24-bx": "Experience the unique fusion of coffee and tobacco with TABAK ESPECIAL DULCE TORO cigars from Drew Estate. These premium handmade cigars feature a dark, oily wrapper infused with rich coffee essence, delivering an exceptionally smooth and aromatic smoking experience. The toro vitola provides an ideal draw and burn, while the dulce blend offers sweet, creamy notes balanced with earthy tobacco flavors. Perfect for coffee lovers and those seeking something distinctively different. Each box contains 24 expertly crafted cigars that pair beautifully with your favorite morning brew or evening espresso.",
