  "tatuaje-black-corona-gorda-20-bx": "The Tatuaje Black Corona Gorda delivers an intense, full-bodied smoking experience that showcases the brand's commitment to premium craftsmanship. This robust cigar features a dark, oily wrapper that hints at the bold flavors within. Expertly constructed with carefully selected tobaccos, it offers rich notes of espresso, dark chocolate, and subtle spice that develop beautifully throughout the smoke. The Corona Gorda vitola provides an ideal balance of ring gauge and length, allowing the complex blend to unfold over a satisfying 60-90 minute smoking session. Each box contains 20 meticulously crafted cigars, perfect for the discerning enthusiast who appreciates bold, sophisticated flavor profiles. A standout choice for experienced smokers seeking depth and character.",
