  "tesla-dynamic-2-flame-w-see-thru-butane-display": "The TESLA DYNAMIC 2 delivers reliable dual-flame performance with striking visual appeal. This premium butane lighter features two powerful flame jets for efficient lighting, while the transparent fuel window lets you monitor butane levels at a glance. Built with durable construction and engineered for consistent ignition, this lighter combines functionality with modern design aesthetics. The see-through butane display adds both practical convenience and visual interest, eliminating guesswork about fuel remaining. Whether for cigars, pipes, or everyday use, the TESLA DYNAMIC 2 offers dependable performance and refillable convenience. Its robust build quality ensures long-lasting service, while the dual-flame system provides superior heat output for any lighting task. A perfect blend of utility and style for discerning users.",
  "tesla-metallic-ombre-pencil-torch-display": "This sleek TESLA metallic ombre pencil torch delivers precision lighting in a sophisticated design. The gradient metallic finish creates an eye-catching visual appeal while maintaining a slim, portable profile perfect for pocket carry. Features a reliable piezo ignition system for consistent flame production and an adjustable flame control for versatility. The refillable butane system ensures long-lasting performance, while the sturdy metal construction provides durability for daily use. Ideal for lighting cigars, pipes, or other smoking accessories with pinpoint accuracy. The pencil-thin form factor makes it an excellent choice for enthusiasts who value both functionality and style. Comes ready for retail display.",
